# Tina CMS Environment Variables
#
# For local development with Vite, use VITE_ prefixed variables
# For production deployment (Cloudflare Pages, etc.), use non-prefixed variables
#
# To get these values:
# 1. Sign up at https://app.tina.io
# 2. Connect your GitHub repository
# 3. Get your Client ID and Token from the Tina Cloud dashboard

# Local Development (Vite)
VITE_TINA_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
VITE_TINA_TOKEN=your_token_here
VITE_TINA_BRANCH=main

# Production/Build (Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, etc.)
# Set these in your hosting provider's dashboard:
# TINA_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
# TINA_TOKEN=your_token_here
